    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "The DSP method achieves state-of-the-art performance on the miniF2F dataset with the Isabelle theorem prover. The results show that the method can <strong>successfully prove a large portion of theorems</strong> using both human-written and language-model-generated informal proofs. The method also <strong>outperforms existing baselines</strong>, including Sledgehammer and Thor.",
